msgstr "Announcement of a construction or other project"

#: oznameni/templates/components/uvod.html:5
msgid "oznameni.templates.components.uvod.text"
msgstr ""
"<p><strong>Announcement of construction or other project carried out in an "
"area with archaeological finds</strong> must be made in accordance with <a "
"href=\"https://www.zakonyprolidi.cz/cs/1987-20#cast3\" target=\"_blank\">§ "
"22(2) of Act No. 20/1987 Coll. on State Monument Care</a> by anyone who "
"carries out construction or other activities (terrain interventions) in an "
"<a href=\"https://isad.npu.cz/\" target=\"_blank\">area with archaeological "
"finds</a>. The notification can be made via this web form operated by the "
"Institutes of Archaeology of the Czech Academy of Sciences in Prague and "
"Brno.</p>"

#: oznameni/templates/components/uvod.html:6
msgid "oznameni.templates.components.warning.text"
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"padding: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-top: 5px;\">This form "
"<strong>is not intended for submitting requests for statements on the "
"preparation of construction or other activities!</strong> For statements for"
" the purposes of building authorities, please contact us by e-mail at <a "
"href=\"mailto:oznameni@arup.cas.cz\">oznameni@arup.cas.cz</a> (Bohemia) or "
"<a href='mailto:podatelna@arub.cz'>podatelna@arub.cz</a> (Moravia and "
"Silesia). For information on the documentation required for the building "
"approval process, please contact the authorised archaeological organisation "
"that carried out the rescue archaeological fieldwork.</div>"

