#: oznameni/templates/oznameni/podminky.html:4
msgid "oznameni.templates.oznameni.podminky.header"
msgstr ""
"INFORMATION ABOUT YOUR RIGHTS REGARDING THE PROTECTION OF PERSONAL DATA"

#: oznameni/templates/oznameni/podminky.html:6
msgid "oznameni.templates.oznameni.index.uvodniInformace.title"
msgstr "INTRODUCTORY INFORMATION"

#: oznameni/templates/oznameni/podminky.html:7
msgid "oznameni.templates.oznameni.index.uvodniInformace.text"
msgstr ""
"Please pay attention to the following document, through which we provide you"
" with information about the processing of your personal data and your rights"
" related to your obligation as a builder pursuant to Section 22(2) of Act "
"No. 20/1987 Coll., on State Monument Care (hereinafter also referred to as "
"the \"Act\"), to provide information about the intention to carry out "
"construction activities in an area with archaeological finds or other "
"activities that could jeopardise the performance of archaeological "
"fieldwork, either to the Institute of Archaeology of the Czech Academy of "
"Sciences, Prague, ID No. 67985912, with its registered office at Letenská 4,"
" 118 01 Prague 1, or to the Institute of Archaeology of the Czech Academy of"
" Sciences, Brno, ID No. 68081758, with its registered office at Čechyňská "
"363/19, 602 Brno, as authorised institutions under the relevant provisions "
"of the law. Any handling of personal data is governed by applicable legal "
"regulations, in particular the Personal Data Protection Act and Regulation "
"(EU) No. 2016/679 of 27 April 2016 on the protection of natural persons with"
" regard to the processing of personal data and on the free movement of such "
"data, and repealing Directive 95/46/EC (hereinafter referred to as the "
"\"General Data Protection Regulation\"). In accordance with the provisions "
"of Article 13 et seq. of the General Data Protection Regulation, we provide "
"you, as data subjects, with the following information. This document is "
"public and serves to properly inform you about the scope, purpose and "
"duration of the processing of personal data and to instruct you about your "
"rights in relation to their protection."

#: oznameni/templates/oznameni/podminky.html:9
msgid "oznameni.templates.oznameni.index.spravce.title"
msgstr "WHO IS THE CONTROLLER OF PERSONAL DATA?"

#: oznameni/templates/oznameni/podminky.html:10
msgid "oznameni.templates.oznameni.index.spravce.text"
msgstr ""
"The joint Controllers of personal data are the Institute of Archaeology of "
"the Czech Academy of Sciences, Prague, ID No.: 67985912, with its registered"
" office at Letenská 4, 118 01 Prague 1, and the Institute of Archaeology "
"Institute of the Czech Academy of Sciences, Brno, ID No.: 68081758, with its"
" registered office at Čechyňská 363/19, 602 00 Brno (hereinafter referred to"
" as the \"Controller\" or \"Archaeological Institute\")."

#: oznameni/templates/oznameni/podminky.html:12
msgid "oznameni.templates.oznameni.index.obecne.title"
msgstr "GENERAL - WHAT CONSTITUTES PERSONAL DATA?"

#: oznameni/templates/oznameni/podminky.html:13
msgid "oznameni.templates.oznameni.index.obecne.text"
msgstr ""
"Personal data is any information relating to an identified or identifiable "
"natural person (human being) on the basis of which a specific natural person"
" can be directly or indirectly identified. Personal data thus includes a "
"wide range of information, such as name, gender, age and date of birth, "
"marital status, photograph (or any image), birth number, permanent "
"residence, telephone number, e-mail, health insurance details, nationality, "
"health status (physical and mental), as well as fingerprints, signatures or "
"IP addresses."

#: oznameni/templates/oznameni/podminky.html:15
msgid "oznameni.templates.oznameni.index.ucel.title"
msgstr "FOR WHAT PURPOSE AND ON WHAT BASIS DO WE PROCESS YOUR PERSONAL DATA?"

#: oznameni/templates/oznameni/podminky.html:16
msgid "oznameni.templates.oznameni.index.ucel.text"
msgstr ""
"We process your personal data because we are required to do so by law, "
"specifically § 22 paragraph 2 of Act No. 20/1987 Coll., on State Monument "
"Care, which stipulates that a builder who intends to carry out construction "
"work in an area with archaeological finds, or other activities that could "
"jeopardise the performance of archaeological fieldwork, is obligated to "
"first announceme this intention to the Archaeological Institute. Reflecting "
"this obligation of the builder is the obligation of the Archaeological "
"Institute to accept and process this announcement. When processing the "
"builder's announcement, the Archaeological Institute processes the builder's"
" personal data as a data subject pursuant to Article 6 paragraph 1(c) and "
"(e) of the General Data Protection Regulation, and the Archaeological "
"Institute is in the position of a Controller. We process your personal data "
"to the extent specified below solely so that the Archaeological Institute or"
" another authorised organisation may contact you in accordance with the law "
"for the purpose of conducting a rescue archaeological survey."

#: oznameni/templates/oznameni/podminky.html:18
msgid "oznameni.templates.oznameni.index.rozsah.title"
msgstr "SCOPE OF PERSONAL DATA PROCESSED BY THE CONTROLLER"

#: oznameni/templates/oznameni/podminky.html:19
msgid "oznameni.templates.oznameni.index.rozsah.text"
msgstr ""
"We inform you that your personal data is processed to the extent that you "
"have filled in the form, specifically to the extent of:"

#: oznameni/templates/oznameni/podminky.html:22
msgid "oznameni.templates.oznameni.index.rozsah.jmeno"
msgstr "name"

#: oznameni/templates/oznameni/podminky.html:23
msgid "oznameni.templates.oznameni.index.rozsah.prijmeni"
msgstr "surname"

#: oznameni/templates/oznameni/podminky.html:24
msgid "oznameni.templates.oznameni.index.rozsah.adresa"
msgstr "address"

#: oznameni/templates/oznameni/podminky.html:25
msgid "oznameni.templates.oznameni.index.rozsah.telefon"
msgstr "telephone number"

#: oznameni/templates/oznameni/podminky.html:26
msgid "oznameni.templates.oznameni.index.rozsah.email"
msgstr "e-mail"

#: oznameni/templates/oznameni/podminky.html:27
msgid "oznameni.templates.oznameni.index.rozsah.udaje"
msgstr ""
"information about the property (parcel number and detailed specifications of"
" the subject of the announcement)"

#: oznameni/templates/oznameni/podminky.html:30
msgid "oznameni.templates.oznameni.index.doba.title"
msgstr "PERSONAL DATA PROCESSING TIME"

#: oznameni/templates/oznameni/podminky.html:31
msgid "oznameni.templates.oznameni.index.doba.text"
msgstr ""
"We will store your personal data for as long as necessary, but for a maximum"
" of ten years. These periods are based on legal requirements and on the "
"protection of the data subject's interest in proving compliance with their "
"legal obligations."

#: oznameni/templates/oznameni/podminky.html:33
msgid "oznameni.templates.oznameni.index.dalsiInformace.title"
msgstr "FURTHER INFORMATION ON THE PROCESSING OF PERSONAL DATA"

#: oznameni/templates/oznameni/podminky.html:34
msgid "oznameni.templates.oznameni.index.dalsiInformace.text"
msgstr ""
"The personal data of the data subject is processed automatically in "
"electronic form.The recipients of your personal data, or the results of its "
"processing, areauthorised organisations in accordance with the law. We do "
"not transfer your personal data and do not intend to transfer it to a third "
"country or international organisation."

#: oznameni/templates/oznameni/podminky.html:36
msgid "oznameni.templates.oznameni.index.pouceni.title"
msgstr "INFORMATION ON THE RIGHTS OF DATA SUBJECTS"

#: oznameni/templates/oznameni/podminky.html:37
msgid "oznameni.templates.oznameni.index.pouceni.text1"
msgstr ""
"The data subject has the right to request the Controller to provide information about the processing of their personal data.\n"
"<br />\n"
"The data subject has the right to have the Controller correct inaccurate personal data concerning him or her without undue delay. Taking into account the purposes of the processing, the data subject has the right to have incomplete personal data completed, including by means of providing a supplementary statement. The data subject has the right to have the Controller erase personal data concerning him or her without undue delay, and the Controller has the obligation to erase personal data without undue delay if any of the reasons specified in the General Data Protection Regulation apply.\n"
"<br />\n"
"The data subject has the right to have the Controller restrict the processing of personal data in cases specified by the General Data Protection Regulation.\n"
"<br />\n"
"If the data subject believes that there has been a breach of the law in relation to the protection of their personal data, they have the right to lodge a complaint with the supervisory authority. The supervisory authority in the Czech Republic is the Office for Personal Data Protection."

#: oznameni/templates/oznameni/podminky.html:39
msgid "oznameni.templates.oznameni.index.datum"
msgstr "In Prague on 25 May 2018"

#: oznameni/templates/oznameni/success.html:5
msgid "oznameni.templates.oznameni.sucess.title"
msgstr "Announcement of a construction or other project"

#: oznameni/templates/oznameni/success.html:23
msgid "oznameni.templates.oznameni.sucess.stepper.vytvoreniOznameni"
msgstr "Creating announcement"

#: oznameni/templates/oznameni/success.html:30
msgid "oznameni.templates.oznameni.sucess.stepper.uploadProjDokumentace"
msgstr "Uploading project documentation"

#: oznameni/templates/oznameni/success.html:37
msgid "oznameni.templates.oznameni.sucess.stepper.oznameno"
msgstr "Announced"

#: oznameni/templates/oznameni/success.html:44
msgid "oznameni.templates.oznameni.sucess.dakujemeText1"
msgstr "Thank you for your announcement"

#: oznameni/templates/oznameni/success.html:45
msgid "oznameni.templates.oznameni.sucess.dakujemeText2"
msgstr ""
"<p class=\"lead\">of your construction or other project in an area with archaeological finds and fulfil the obligation imposed by Act No. 20/1987 Coll. on State Monument Care, as amended.</p>\n"
"<p class=\"lead\">Your announcement has been entered into the Archaeological Map of the Czech Republic information system, which is used by organisations authorised to carry out archaeological fieldwork. In the near future, you can expect to be contacted by one of the authorised organisations with a request to conclude an agreement on the performance of rescue archaeological fieldwork.</p>\n"
"<p class=\"lead\">If you are not contacted in this matter within the next 30 days, there is nothing to prevent you from starting the earthworks. However, we would like to point out that <strong>in the event of an unexpected archaeological find, it is still your responsibility</strong> under <a href=\"https://www.zakonyprolidi.cz/cs/2021-283# cast6\" target=\"_blank\">§ 266 of Act No. 283/2021 Coll. (Building Act)</a> to immediately report this fact to the building authority and also to the Archaeological Institute or the nearest museum in accordance with <a href=\"https://www.zakonyprolidi.cz/cs/1987-20# cast3\" target=\"_blank\">Section 23(2) of Act No. 20/1987 Coll. on State Monument Care</a>.</p>"

#: oznameni/templates/oznameni/success.html:48
msgid "oznameni.templates.oznameni.sucess.dakujemeText9"
msgstr ""
"The announced project has been successfully saved under identification "
"number"

#: oznameni/templates/oznameni/success.html:50
msgid "oznameni.templates.oznameni.sucess.dakujemeText10"
msgstr ""
"<p class=\"lead\">You will find a summary of your announcement at the email address you provided. <strong>Confirmation of your announcement will be sent to the email address you provided after the announcement has been checked and approved by the Archaeological Institute.</strong></p>\n"
"<p class=\"lead\">If you have entered incorrect information, please do not hesitate to contact us at <a href=\"mailto:oznameni@arup.cas.cz\">oznameni@arup.cas.cz</a> (Bohemia) or <a href='mailto:oznameni@arub.cz'>oznameni@arub.cz</a> (Moravia and Silesia).</p>\n"
"<p class=\"lead\">You can now close this page or report another project.</p>"

#: oznameni/templates/oznameni/success.html:51
msgid "oznameni.templates.oznameni.sucess.oznamitDalsiProjekt"
msgstr "Report another project"

