msgstr ""
"Cookies in your browser are small pieces of data that websites store on your"
" computer. This information can contain various details, such as your login "
"details, preferences on a given website, or the contents of your shopping "
"basket in an online shop. <br /><br /> When you return to the site, the "
"browser sends the stored cookies back to the server, allowing the website to"
" remember you. This allows the website to immediately load your settings, "
"such as your chosen language, or automatically log you in without you having"
" to re-enter your username and password. Cookies are useful for both users "
"and website operators because they simplify and enhance the browsing "
"experience. Below is an overview of the cookies stored by the AMCR "
"application"

